  "$u^2 = a^2 + b^2 + c^2 = {@0} + {@1} + {@2} = {@3}$, teda $u = {@4}$ cm.": "$u^2 = a^2 + b^2 + c^2 = {@0} + {@1} + {@2} = {@3}$, yani $u = {@4}$ cm.",
